{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type ContentPart<TTextMeta, TImageMeta, TAudioMeta, TVideoMeta, TDocumentMeta> = \n  | TextPart<TTextMeta>\n  | ImagePart<TImageMeta>\n  | AudioPart<TAudioMeta>\n  | VideoPart<TVideoMeta>\n| DocumentPart<TDocumentMeta>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L326","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:326"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Union type for all multimodal content parts."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ttextmeta","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TTextMeta"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TTextMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"timagemeta","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TImageMeta"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TImageMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider-specific image metadata type"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"taudiometa","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TAudioMeta"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAudioMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider-specific audio metadata type"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvideometa","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TVideoMeta"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TVideoMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider-specific video metadata type"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdocumentmeta","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TDocumentMeta"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TDocumentMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider-specific document metadata type"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"ttextmeta","text":"TTextMeta","level":3},{"id":"timagemeta","text":"TImageMeta","level":3},{"id":"taudiometa","text":"TAudioMeta","level":3},{"id":"tvideometa","text":"TVideoMeta","level":3},{"id":"tdocumentmeta","text":"TDocumentMeta","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ContentPart<TTextMeta, TImageMeta, TAudioMeta, TVideoMeta, TDocumentMeta> = \n  | TextPart<TTextMeta>\n  | ImagePart<TImageMeta>\n  | AudioPart<TAudioMeta>\n  | VideoPart<TVideoMeta>\n| DocumentPart<TDocumentMeta>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:326](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L326)\n\nUnion type for all multimodal content parts.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TTextMeta\n\n`TTextMeta` = `unknown`\n\n### TImageMeta\n\n`TImageMeta` = `unknown`\n\nProvider-specific image metadata type\n\n### TAudioMeta\n\n`TAudioMeta` = `unknown`\n\nProvider-specific audio metadata type\n\n### TVideoMeta\n\n`TVideoMeta` = `unknown`\n\nProvider-specific video metadata type\n\n### TDocumentMeta\n\n`TDocumentMeta` = `unknown`\n\nProvider-specific document metadata type\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ContentPart\ntitle: ContentPart\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ContentPart<TTextMeta, TImageMeta, TAudioMeta, TVideoMeta, TDocumentMeta> = \n  | TextPart<TTextMeta>\n  | ImagePart<TImageMeta>\n  | AudioPart<TAudioMeta>\n  | VideoPart<TVideoMeta>\n| DocumentPart<TDocumentMeta>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:326](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L326)\n\nUnion type for all multimodal content parts.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TTextMeta\n\n`TTextMeta` = `unknown`\n\n### TImageMeta\n\n`TImageMeta` = `unknown`\n\nProvider-specific image metadata type\n\n### TAudioMeta\n\n`TAudioMeta` = `unknown`\n\nProvider-specific audio metadata type\n\n### TVideoMeta\n\n`TVideoMeta` = `unknown`\n\nProvider-specific video metadata type\n\n### TDocumentMeta\n\n`TDocumentMeta` = `unknown`\n\nProvider-specific document metadata type\n"}
